<title>RUSSIA: Russian Dec PPI slows to 0.8 pct, 25.6 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russian Dec PPI slows to 0.8 pct, 25.6 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rise in Russian monthly industrial prices slowed to 0.8 percent in December from 0.9 percent in November, putting the PPI for the whole year at 25.6 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES   Dec 96   Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +0.8	+0.9	+2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +25.6     +26.9    +175</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
